---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = "Shopify Apps for Promotional Products | Swishtag Rocket Apps";
const description = "Explore focused Shopify apps for promotional products stores, company stores and custom ecommerce workflows.";
const canonical = "https://cms.swishtag.com/platforms/shopify-apps-for-promotional-products/";
const robots = "index,follow";
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical} robots={robots}>
  <link slot="head" rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/generic-page.css" />
  <main><section class="gp-hero"><div class="gp-wrap"><div class="gp-kicker">Rocket Apps</div><h1>Add the missing Shopify capability without overbuilding.</h1><p>Rocket Apps are focused Shopify tools for common promotional products and company-store use cases. Use a small app when a small app solves the problem.</p><div class="gp-actions"><a class="gp-btn primary" href="../book-demo/">Book a demo ↗</a><a class="gp-btn secondary" href="../solutions/">Explore solutions</a></div></div></section><section class="gp-section"><div class="gp-wrap"><div class="gp-section-head"><h2>Small apps should stay small.</h2><p>The point is not to add more software. The point is to solve a narrow problem cleanly while keeping the storefront maintainable.</p></div><div class="gp-grid"><article aria-label="Open Request a Quote" class="gp-card st-clickable-card" data-card-href="../contact/" role="link" tabindex="0"><small>QUOTING</small><h3>Request a Quote</h3><p>Add a clearer quote path when standard checkout is not the right next step.</p><a href="../contact/">Ask about the app →</a></article><article aria-label="Open Keep &amp; Share Cart" class="gp-card st-clickable-card" data-card-href="../contact/" role="link" tabindex="0"><small>SHARING</small><h3>Keep &amp; Share Cart</h3><p>Help teams save or share a prepared cart for internal review or customer approval.</p><a href="../contact/">Ask about the app →</a></article><article aria-label="Open Store utilities" class="gp-card st-clickable-card" data-card-href="../contact/" role="link" tabindex="0"><small>MERCHANDISING</small><h3>Store utilities</h3><p>Add focused functions such as scheduled images, gift-card workflows or other store-specific utilities.</p><a href="../contact/">Explore options →</a></article></div></div></section><section class="gp-section alt"><div class="gp-wrap"><div class="gp-split"><div><h2>What this page will cover</h2></div><div class="gp-list"><div>Use native Shopify features first.</div><div>Add an app when the requirement is repeatable and well defined.</div><div>Use custom development when an app would create awkward workarounds.</div><div>Keep app count and theme impact under control.</div></div></div></div></section><section class="gp-section"><div class="gp-wrap"><div class="gp-cta"><div><h2>Have a workflow that does not fit off-the-shelf software?</h2><p>Show us the current process. We can help identify the simplest Shopify, integration, or automation approach before you commit to a larger build.</p></div><a class="gp-btn" href="../book-demo/">Book a demo ↗</a></div><p class="gp-note">This page is connected and launch-ready. Detailed sales copy, proof, screenshots and SEO depth can be expanded in the next content pass.</p></div></section></main>
</BaseLayout>
